  "reflectionText": "The king of Israel came down a line that began with a Moabite woman who had said your people shall be my people. Obed to Jesse, Jesse to David. What is it to come into a kingdom through a line that began with a foreign woman saying your people shall be my people — and to count her among the names you were given when you were born?"
